### Variables Globales
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@adminToken = Bearer admin-user123
@customerToken1 = Bearer customer-cust456
@customerToken2 = Bearer customer-cust789

# =================================================================
# 1. SUPLEMENTOS (SUPPLEMENTS)
# =================================================================

### 1.1 Listar Suplementos (Sin filtros - Primera página)
GET {{baseUrl}}/supplements
    ?page=1
    &limit=5

### 1.2 Listar Suplementos con Filtro de Búsqueda (search=creatina)
GET {{baseUrl}}/supplements
    ?search=creatina

### 1.3 Listar Suplementos con Filtro de Categoría (category=Minerales)
GET {{baseUrl}}/supplements
    ?category=Minerales

### 1.4 Listar Suplementos con Filtro de Stock (inStock=true)
GET {{baseUrl}}/supplements
    ?inStock=true

### 1.5 Obtener Detalle de Suplemento (Existente: Proteína Whey)
GET {{baseUrl}}/supplements/c0a80101-1111-4444-8888-999999999999

### 1.6 Obtener Detalle de Suplemento (No Existente -> 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/supplements/c0a80101-9999-4444-8888-999999999999

### 1.7 Crear Suplemento Exitoso (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/supplements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Glutamina Ultra",
  "brand": "MuscleTech",
  "category": "Recuperación",
  "presentation": "Polvo 300g",
  "dosage": "5g post-entrenamiento",
  "price": 380.00,
  "stock": 10,
  "requiresPrescription": false,
  "description": "Glutamina micronizada pura para la recuperación y salud intestinal."
}

### 1.8 Crear Suplemento - Conflicto de Nombre (409 Conflict)
# Intentar crear "Proteína Whey Premium" que ya existe
POST {{baseUrl}}/supplements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Proteína Whey Premium",
  "brand": "Optimum Nutrition",
  "category": "Proteínas",
  "presentation": "Polvo 2kg",
  "dosage": "1 scoop diario (30g)",
  "price": 899.90,
  "stock": 15,
  "requiresPrescription": false
}

### 1.9 Crear Suplemento - Error de Validación (422 Unprocessable Entity)
# Faltan campos obligatorios o tipos de datos incorrectos
POST {{baseUrl}}/supplements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "brand": "Marca Falsa",
  "price": -10.50,
  "stock": 1.5
}

### 1.10 Actualizar Suplemento Parcial (200 OK)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/supplements/c0a80101-1111-4444-8888-999999999999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 950.00,
  "stock": 18,
  "description": "Precio actualizado de Whey Premium con mayor stock disponible."
}

### 1.11 Actualizar Suplemento - Validación Incorrecta (422)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/supplements/c0a80101-1111-4444-8888-999999999999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stock": -5
}

### 1.12 Eliminar Suplemento Exitoso (204 No Content)
# Primero creamos uno temporal para eliminarlo
# NOTA: OBTENER SU ID DE LA RESPUESTA DE CREACIÓN E INSERTARLO ABAJO
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/supplements/c0a80101-3333-4444-8888-999999999999


# =================================================================
# 2. PEDIDOS (ORDERS)
# =================================================================

### 2.1 Intentar Crear Pedido sin Autenticación (401 Unauthorized)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notes": "Entrega por la tarde",
  "items": [
    {
      "supplementId": "c0a80101-1111-4444-8888-999999999999",
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### 2.2 Crear Pedido Exitoso como Cliente (201 Created)
# Se reduce el stock de Proteína Whey (id: 1111...) y Hierro Médico (id: 4444...)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: {{customerToken1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notes": "Dejar en recepción por favor.",
  "items": [
    {
      "supplementId": "c0a80101-1111-4444-8888-999999999999",
      "quantity": 2
    },
    {
      "supplementId": "c0a80101-4444-4444-8888-999999999999",
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### 2.3 Crear Pedido - Error de Validación de Stock (422 Unprocessable Entity)
# Intentamos comprar Creatina (stock disponible: 25) pero pedimos 100
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: {{customerToken2}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notes": "Compra masiva",
  "items": [
    {
      "supplementId": "c0a80101-2222-4444-8888-999999999999",
      "quantity": 100
    }
  ]
}

### 2.4 Listar Todos los Pedidos como Admin (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

### 2.5 Listar Pedidos como Cliente sin Privilegios de Admin (403 Forbidden)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: {{customerToken1}}

### 2.6 Listar "Mis Pedidos" (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/me
Authorization: {{customerToken1}}

### 2.7 Obtener Detalle de Pedido Propio (200 OK)
# Reemplazar el UUID con el ID generado en la creación del paso 2.2
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/REEMPLAZAR_CON_ID_PEDIDO
Authorization: {{customerToken1}}

### 2.8 Obtener Detalle de Pedido Ajeno como Cliente (403 Forbidden)
# El cliente 2 intenta ver el pedido del cliente 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/REEMPLAZAR_CON_ID_PEDIDO
Authorization: {{customerToken2}}

### 2.9 Obtener Detalle de Pedido Ajeno como Administrador (200 OK)
# El admin puede ver cualquier pedido
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/REEMPLAZAR_CON_ID_PEDIDO
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

### 2.10 Cancelar Pedido (200 OK)
# Restaura el stock de los suplementos del pedido cancelado
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/REEMPLAZAR_CON_ID_PEDIDO/cancel
Authorization: {{customerToken1}}


# =================================================================
# 3. DETALLE DE ÍTEMS DE PEDIDOS (ORDER ITEMS)
# =================================================================

### 3.1 Listar ítems de un Pedido (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/REEMPLAZAR_CON_ID_PEDIDO/items
Authorization: {{customerToken1}}

### 3.2 Agregar Ítem a un Pedido Existente (201 Created)
# Agrega Creatina (c0a80101-2222-4444-8888-999999999999) al pedido pendiente
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/REEMPLAZAR_CON_ID_PEDIDO/items
Authorization: {{customerToken1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplementId": "c0a80101-2222-4444-8888-999999999999",
  "quantity": 3
}

### 3.3 Agregar Ítem - Error de Validación de Stock (422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/REEMPLAZAR_CON_ID_PEDIDO/items
Authorization: {{customerToken1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplementId": "c0a80101-2222-4444-8888-999999999999",
  "quantity": 1000
}

### 3.4 Eliminar Ítem de un Pedido (204 No Content)
# Elimina el ítem y restaura su stock correspondiente
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/orders/REEMPLAZAR_CON_ID_PEDIDO/items/REEMPLAZAR_CON_ID_ITEM
Authorization: {{customerToken1}}
